            "review_title": "Review at PAT's Sandwich",
            "review_text": "Lets Dive\nDuluth, Georgia26 contributions\n0\nGreat portion\nAug 2016 • Friends\nI love to order the banh mi here. However, sometimes the banh mi seems to be very hard and a little old. It's not hot and crispy. The portion is great for the value.\nI especially love the large smoothies they offer and the fruit yogurt shake.\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 20, 2016",
